== Icelandic ==

=== Verb ===

'''liggja'''

# to [[lie]] (on a bed etc.)
# to be [[located]], to [[lie]]
# to [[lead]]

====Derived terms====
*[[liggja vel á]] (to be in hight spirits)
*: ''Það '''liggur vel á''' mér.''
*:: I am in '''hight spirits'''.
*[[liggja fyrir]] (to [[lie]] in [[bed]])
*[[liggja í augum uppi]] (to be obvious]]
*[[liggja í því]] (to be in trouble)
*: ''Þarna '''liggurðu í því'''.''
*:: Now you're '''in trouble'''. (literally "there '''you're in trouble'''") 
*[[allir vegir liggja til Rómar]]

